        "reference": "FLAVOR_TEXT",
        "subject": "Flavor Text"
      },
      "translations": {
        "de_DE": {
          "text": "Chaos kann Enttäuschungen mit sich bringen, aber es ist auch der Ort, an dem man die wunderbarsten Schätze entdeckt!",
          "locale": "de_DE"
        },
        "es_ES": {
          "text": "Sí, el caos puede ser una lata, ¡pero también contiene las gemas ocultas más maravillásticas!",
          "locale": "es_ES"
        },
        "en_US": {
          "text": "Chaos can bring disappointment, sure, but it's also where ye'll find the most wonderfullest hidden gems!",
          "locale": "en_US"
        },
        "fr_FR": {
          "text": "Le chaos est source de désillusions, mais recèle aussi les plus belles pépites !",
          "locale": "fr_FR"
        },
        "it_IT": {
          "text": "Il caos può portare delusione, certo, ma è lì che troverai le gemme nascoste più spettacolose!",
          "locale": "it_IT"
        }
      },
      "id": "01HNJH5T2QW9FYB8STZQHFGDSD",
      "text": "Chaos can bring disappointment, sure, but it's also where ye'll find the most wonderfullest hidden gems!"
    }
  ],
